WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.134 --> 00:00:11.673
Miss Gray: Please line up, everybody.

2
00:00:11.674 --> 00:00:14.690
Miss Gray: We're going to see the fire truck now.

3
00:00:14.691 --> 00:00:21.024
Mr. Brown: Miss Gray? May I—?

4
00:00:21.025 --> 00:00:23.907
Miss Gray: Oh, I see . . . Okay.

5
00:00:23.908 --> 00:00:28.745
Miss Gray: Boys and girls, Mr. Brown wants to give us something right away.

6
00:00:28.746 --> 00:00:32.094
Miss Gray: So we'll hear about his job first.

7
00:00:32.095 --> 00:00:37.839
Miss Gray: Then we'll go see the fire truck.

8
00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:41.194
Mr. Brown: My job is to sell—

9
00:00:41.195 --> 00:00:44.137
Class: Ice cream!

10
00:00:44.138 --> 00:00:49.746
Mr. Brown: Right! And the treats I brought you are melting fast.

11
00:00:49.747 --> 00:01:05.427
Mr. Brown: So dig in, kids!

12
00:01:05.428 --> 00:01:07.750
Miss Gray: Thank you, Mr. Brown.

13
00:01:07.751 --> 00:01:10.534
Miss Gray: We enjoyed hearing about your job.

14
00:01:10.535 --> 00:01:13.613
Miss Gray: Now it's time to see the fire truck.

15
00:01:13.614 --> 00:01:20.585
Please line up.

16
00:01:20.586 --> 00:01:25.433
Mark: Greg, your grandpa is really nice.

17
00:01:25.434 --> 00:01:28.026
Jim: He was the best.

18
00:01:28.027 --> 00:01:39.222
Jim: When I grow up, I'm going to sell ice cream too!

19
00:01:39.223 --> 00:01:42.159
Uncle Mike: Who wants to steer the fire truck?

20
00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:44.175
Kara: Not me, thanks.

21
00:01:44.176 --> 00:01:46.423
I did it last year.

22
00:01:46.424 --> 00:01:51.802
Jim: I'm too full from ice cream!

23
00:01:51.803 --> 00:01:53.900
Daisy: What's going on?

24
00:01:53.901 --> 00:01:59.142
Woman: Here, Mittens.

25
00:01:59.143 --> 00:02:04.970
Jenna: Oh no. That poor kitten is stuck in the tree!

26
00:02:04.971 --> 00:02:06.821
Uncle Mike: Excuse me, kids.

27
00:02:06.822 --> 00:02:22.736
This is an emergency!

28
00:02:22.737 --> 00:02:25.553
Class: Wow! Yay!

29
00:02:25.554 --> 00:02:27.747
Daisy: Uncle Mike is a hero!

30
00:02:27.748 --> 00:02:30.039
Jim: Forget ice cream.

31
00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:33.668
I want to be a firefighter when I grow up!

32
00:02:33.669 --> 00:02:38.008
Greg: Me too! Coby, your uncle is awesome.

33
00:02:38.009 --> 00:02:40.957
Coby: I know.

34
00:02:40.958 --> 00:02:44.338
Uncle Mike: Does anybody want to steer the truck?

35
00:02:44.339 --> 00:02:48.935
Kids: Me! I do!
